"use strict";(self.webpackChunkciroh_docuhub=self.webpackChunkciroh_docuhub||[]).push([["16309"],{62001(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":"community-resources","title":"Community Resources Working Group","description":"Informs the planning of CIROH\'s community resources, including research cyberinfrastructure (computing and storage capacity), research hydrology forecasting capabilities (NGIAB, NRDS), community documentation (CIROH Hub), and products/datasets (Portal). Oversees organization and dissemination of resources through CIROH Hub, Portal, HydroShare, and other outlets.","leads":["Arpita Patel, The University of Alabama"],"reportsCollectionId":"","annual":{"period":"2025-2026","objectives":["Provide inputs for the CIROH CyberInfrastructure roadmaps to meet community and research needs, governance documents, establish cybersecurity protocols and documentation for products/tools developed/deployed using CIROH IT.","Plan and develop the roadmap for community open source projects, develop governance, PR review process, implement CI/CD pipelines, automated tests and monitoring frameworks to accelerate deployment cycles.","Establish the community contributions guidelines for documentation on CIROH Hub, governance and help community adopt IT and DevOps tools and processes.","Provide technical assistance, training sessions, and collaboratively develop articles/publications/presentations."],"accomplishments":["Monthly virtual meetings.","Integrated 10+ models into NextGen In A Box (NGIAB) (Objective #2)","Expanded research datastream configurations using NGIAB to 6 active datastreams","Supported extensive cloud and HPC usage, recording 76 users on AWS, 95 on GCP + 2i2c, 71 on Pantarhei + Wukong, and 141 on NSF ACCESS. (Objective #1)","Merged DocuHub and Portal repositories and deployed the CIROH Hub in March 2026 with new apps, documents and improved accessibility. Helped drive the total number of blogs to 30. (Objective #2)","CIROH Hub as centralized place for CIROH resources totaling 36 applications, 45 datasets, 271 publications, 40 presentations, 7 notebooks, and 19 courses as of September 2026. (Objective #2)","Published three papers from research projects - NGIAB, CCNH and NRDS (in review) are published out of this WG members. (Objective #4)","Two (2) presentations by group members about research projects. (CCNH, NRDS) (Objective #4)","Identification of six (6) training workshops for the Community NextGen track in the 2026 CIROH Developers Conference (Objective #4)"],"products":["CIROH Hub - hub.ciroh.org","CIROH Community NextGen Ecosystem: https://hub.ciroh.org/docs/products/ngiab-ecosystem/, https://ngiab.ciroh.org","CIROH Cyberinfrastructure - Research to Operation Hybrid Cloud (R2OHC) Platform: https://hub.ciroh.org/docs/services/intro"]}}')}}]);